# Normalize line endings (拍板项 2, 2026-10-27): the repository and the
# working tree both stay LF (eol=lf overrides core.autocrlf's CRLF checkout,
# which kept ghost-modified files alive on Windows); explicit binary markers
# keep images/fonts out of any translation.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending translated or diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
